ORDINANCE XXIII OF 1961
WEST
PAKISTAN (UNIVERSITY OF PESHAWAR) ORDINANCE, 1961
CHAPTER IV‑AUTHORITIES OF
THE UNIVERSITY
14. Authorities.‑The following shall be the Authorities of the
University :‑
(i) the Syndicate ;
(ii) the Academic Council;
(iii) the Board of Studies ;
(iv) the Selection Board ;
(v) the Committee for Advanced
Studies and Research ;
(vi) the Finance Committee;
(vii) the Planning and
Development Committee ; and
(viii) such other Authorities
as may be provided for in the Statutes.
